The Qlib-derived execution arithmetic is adapted from qlib/backtest/exchange.py in the vendored
snapshot main@79633dd. vqapr changes the implementation to immutable batch inputs, exact
product/side/effective-time cost selection, and structured per-instrument diagnostics.

The full MIT license text for the referenced snapshot is preserved at references/qlib/LICENSE.
